Test negated plane roundtrip
c
c Surface 1 is a general plane with NEGATIVE first coefficient.
c P -1 0 0 -5 means -x = -5, i.e. x = 5.
c In MCNP: f(x,y,z) = -x - (-5) = -x + 5
c   -1 means f < 0: -x + 5 < 0, i.e. x > 5
c   +1 means f > 0: -x + 5 > 0, i.e. x < 5
c
c Cell 1: x < 5 AND inside sphere (mat 1)
c Cell 2: x > 5 AND inside sphere (mat 2)
c Cell 99: outside sphere (graveyard)
c
1 1 -1.0  1 -10
2 2 -2.0 -1 -10
99 0 10

c Surface cards
1 p -1 0 0 -5
10 so 20

m1 92235.80c 1.0
m2 92238.80c 1.0
